{"is_source_file": true, "format": "CMake", "description": "This file is a CMake module script that detects and sets up support for OpenMP in a CMake-based build system. It includes functions to test compiler support for OpenMP, detect relevant compiler flags and libraries, and defines imported targets for OpenMP in C, C++, and Fortran.\n\nKey features include the detection of OpenMP support, retrieval of OpenMP version and specification date, and creation of interface libraries for integrating OpenMP support into the build process.\n\nThe file is used internally by CMake projects to facilitate enabling and configuring OpenMP support based on the compiler's capabilities.", "external_files": ["CMakeParseImplicitLinkInfo", "FindPackageHandleStandardArgs"], "external_methods": ["find_package", "try_compile", "find_path", "find_library", "set_property"], "published": [], "classes": [], "methods": [], "calls": ["cmake_policy(PUSH)", "cmake_policy(SET CMP0012 NEW)", "cmake_policy(SET CMP0054 NEW)", "cmake_policy(SET CMP0057 NEW)", "if(NOT \"$ENV{OMP_PREFIX}\" STREQUAL \"\")", "elseif(${CMAKE_SYSTEM_NAME} STREQUAL \"Darwin\" AND EXISTS /opt/homebrew/opt/libomp)", "set(OpenMP_PREFIX \"$ENV{OMP_PREFIX}\")", "set(OpenMP_PREFIX \"/opt/homebrew/opt/libomp\")", "function(_OPENMP_FLAG_CANDIDATES LANG)", "find_path(__header_dir \"omp.h\")", "find_path(__header_dir \"omp.h\" HINTS \"/usr/local/include\" \"${OpenMP_PREFIX}/include\")", "find_package(MKL QUIET)", "find_library(OpenMP_libomp_LIBRARY ...)", "try_compile( ... )", "include(CMakeParseImplicitLinkInfo)", "set(OpenMP_C_CXX_TEST_SOURCE ...)", "set(OpenMP_Fortran_TEST_SOURCE ...)", "function(_OPENMP_WRITE_SOURCE_FILE ...)", "function(_OPENMP_GET_FLAGS ...)", "set(BIN_FILE \"${CMAKE_BINARY_DIR}${CMAKE_FILES_DIRECTORY}/FindOpenMP/ompver_${LANG}.bin\")", "try_compile(OpenMP_SPECTEST_${LANG}_${OPENMP_PLAIN_FLAG} ...)", "file(STRINGS ${BIN_FILE} specstr LIMIT_COUNT 1 REGEX \"INFO:OpenMP-date\")", "function(_OPENMP_GET_SPEC_DATE ..